think The operator card names the live open-media edge as the growing 5x7 font family, and its Next-open-media line names "more wider symbols (math/technical marks, more geometric fills)" as an agent-doable rung. Math/technical marks is the highest-Lindy crux among those -- a font corpus is read for years, and the operators a terminal prints in a readout are a genuine gap the box/arrow/geometric corpora leave open.
think The rota increments by lap index; the prior lap read item 1 (foundations/README.md), so this lap read item 2, foundations/20260706-185112_follow-our-compass.md -- the return habit, walked oldest conviction to newest lap, Lindy-first crux-first. It confirmed the read order and the "witness before narrative" discipline this round keeps.
think I mirrored image/font5x7_geometric.rye exactly -- same shared 5x7 cell, same advance, same coverage_from_art lift, same build_atlas ascending-codepoint contract, same round-trip crux -- so the new corpus inherits every proven invariant rather than inventing a parallel shape.
think Chose ten operators at real ascending Unicode codepoints: U+00B0 degree, U+00B1 plus-minus, U+00D7 multiplication, U+00F7 division, U+2212 the true minus, U+221E infinity, U+2248 approximately-equal, U+2260 not-equal, U+2264 <=, U+2265 >=. The Latin-1 marks sit far below the mathematical-operators block, so the table is named outright, not derived from a base.
think Drew each glyph as ASCII line art -- the drawings ARE the specification. Ink counts fall 5..14: the bare minus is a single 5-cell bar (the floor), the two comparisons a chevron over a bar (14, the ceiling). Set the legibility band 5..20 around that honest spread.
think Two family orders earn a proof beyond the round-trip: plus-minus (13) and not-equal (13) each out-ink the bare minus (5), each adding a stroke the minus lacks; and the two comparisons mirror to equal weight (14 == 14) yet carry distinct coverage, so distinctness and the mirror hold together.
obs GREEN on the first metal run, no red: 10 marks round-trip byte-identical, all present with the shared advance, none sharing coverage, ink 5..14 of 35, all three family-order proofs held. tame_style_check bans clean (no compound asserts to split this time), width-check exit 0, both files plain 7-bit ASCII though the glyphs cover a non-ASCII range (numeric codepoint literals only).
obs Additive -- a fresh module and its witness; no sibling corpus touched. Pure composition over image/glyph.rye's gfa1 encoder; invents no storage, codec, palette, or font body. No network, no key, no funds -- an agent-doable rung with no custody gate in reach.
loom witness=font5x7_math_witness marks=10 cell=5x7 encoded_bytes=323 raw_bytes=350 ink_lo=5 ink_hi=14
